# USF /proof cockpit gate — COMMITTED CLOSED DEFAULT.
#
# This is the fail-closed default imported by docker/caddy/Caddyfile at
# /srv/caddy-runtime/proof-cockpit-auth.caddy. It responds 503 so the /proof
# cockpit route is CLOSED whenever a proof-review session is not open.
#
# `make caddy-up` seeds a writable runtime copy of this file into the gitignored
# host dir (.proof-review/caddy) bind-mounted to /srv/caddy-runtime. The public
# read-only proof edge stays served regardless of this include.
#
# `make proof-review-up` overwrites the runtime copy with an authenticated body
# (basic_auth { <operator-user> <bcrypt-hash> } then reverse_proxy to the
# staging-proof-cockpit service) and reloads Caddy to OPEN the gate.
# `make proof-review-down` restores this closed default and reloads to CLOSE it.
#
# The operator credential lives only in the gitignored runtime copy, never here
# and never in a committed file or the caddy service environment.
respond "USF proof review surface is not currently open" 503
